	(footprint "filament-kit:ESP32-C3_SuperMini_Socket_PowerLeft"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "e6fc7ed9-0e51-480f-858f-53377a6aa981")
		(at 130 102.5)
		(descr "ESP32-C3 Super Mini on two 1x8 female headers (2.54 mm sockets), 15.24 mm between rows; the module plugs in and is never soldered. POWER-LEFT modules: top view, USB at the top: pads 9-16 left row top to bottom 5V GND 3V3 GPIO4 GPIO3 GPIO2 GPIO1 GPIO0, pads 1-8 right row top to bottom GPIO5 GPIO6 GPIO7 GPIO8 GPIO9 GPIO10 GPIO20 GPIO21. Pad positions match the other hand's socket; only the numbering is swapped between the rows. Module outline 18 x 22.52 mm centred on the pins. A rule area under the antenna end (the end away from USB) keeps tracks, vias and copper pour out; the antenna position on the module is UNCONFIRMED")
		(tags "ESP32-C3 SuperMini module socket female header power-left")
