		(property "Pin_layout" "top view, USB at the top, pins down; the module comes in two hands. Power-left (the reference build): pads 9-16 left row top to bottom 5V GND 3V3 GPIO4 GPIO3 GPIO2 GPIO1 GPIO0, pads 1-8 right row top to bottom GPIO5 GPIO6 GPIO7 GPIO8 GPIO9 GPIO10 GPIO20 GPIO21, footprint filament-kit:ESP32-C3_SuperMini_Socket_PowerLeft (confirmed from the board). Power-right: the rows swapped, pads 1-8 left and 9-16 right, footprint filament-kit:ESP32-C3_SuperMini_Socket. Rows 15.24 mm apart, 2.54 mm pitch"
